sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as 玩家
    participant FE as 前端游戏桌
    participant API as REST API
    participant SSE as SSE事件流
    participant ORC as PhaseOrchestrator
    participant AI as AIActionScheduler
    participant LLM as ModelProvider
    participant DB as EventOutbox/DB

    P->>FE: 进入游戏桌
    FE->>API: GET /games/{id}
    API-->>FE: state_snapshot
    FE->>SSE: GET /games/{id}/stream
    SSE-->>FE: state_snapshot / action_required

    P->>FE: 提交阶段动作
    FE->>API: POST /games/{id}/actions
    API->>ORC: validate + advance
    ORC->>DB: append player_action
    DB-->>SSE: publish player_action
    SSE-->>FE: player_action / phase_changed

    ORC->>AI: create AI decision tasks
    AI->>LLM: prompt with public/private context
    LLM-->>AI: structured decision
    AI->>ORC: validated AI action
    ORC->>DB: append ai_action/public_event/private_event
    DB-->>SSE: publish events
    SSE-->>FE: ai_thinking / player_spoke / vote_cast

    ORC->>ORC: resolve rules and win condition
    ORC->>DB: append state_snapshot
    DB-->>SSE: publish state_snapshot
    SSE-->>FE: scene updates by phase
    FE-->>P: 展示新阶段、时间线、可操作按钮
